{"about_the_game":"Syndeo-Complex is a first-person shooter. It is inspired by games like Half-Life and Doom (1993). You will have to explore twisting levels, fight enemies and solve puzzles. At the end of each level, you will have to defeat tougher enemies: the Nekron Kyttaron. This will allow you to progress in the game and unlock the characters' stories.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988930/extras/syndeo01.gif?t=1669833904\" /><br><br>--<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Here is the story so far</h2><br>You are Dyo. You were born in the spaceship Prophet 60091.<br>You are an annihilator, a human genetically modified and augmented.<br><br>Your mother, whose identity remains secret, died under mysterious circumstances. She was the founder of the mega corporation Syndeo.<br><br>Your father, Enas, commander of the spaceship Prophet 60091, captured Miden, your loved one. His plans are unknown.<br><br>Your goal is to decimate your father's army and to save Miden.<br>To do this, you must kill all the Nekron Kyttaron and then destroy the Prophet 60091 with the SH10151 orbital gun.<br><br>No one will do it for you.<br><br>--<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game includes:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1 mysterious hub that connects all levels<br></li><li>4 levels (5 planned), each with its own environment<br></li><li>3 bosses (5 planned) called Nekron Kyttaron<br></li><li>7 weapons (10 planned) including a pistol, an assault rifle, a missile launcher, a shotgun, etc<br></li><li>16 enemies and characters (19 planned) with their own stories to unlock<br></li><li>3 drugs<br></li><li>12 music tracks (50 minutes), downloadable as free DLC<br></li><li>Philosophical dialogues<br></li><li>Enigmatic storyline</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sign of Evil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1988930/c3ea04b1fba3000d9a8b6f243933e2a38196850c.jpg"},{"name":"The false foundation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1988930/c4363df6cefb059e161622a46874cb54dd9ffd36.jpg"},{"name":"Global warming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1988930/92363d271b2f326b2648c14f3e51f828e612225a.jpg"},{"name":"Night prawler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1988930/3fd2932bb5ab4b8fe476cc022e424d2d9c88f0dc.jpg"},{"name":"I am undone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1988930/12a02e1bf508e2d8c38e83b8594bb31e57c0cf00.jpg"},{"name":"Nuclear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1988930/535e8af7cb0fa712e8451699fca11ec7a5571e26.jpg"},{"name":"No time for caution","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1988930/17e3a2b8da61a31a544688a1af017376942af5a5.jpg"},{"name":"Kings of speed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1988930/89114ebece69e29447838fa55c5f50dc6e560047.jpg"},{"name":"Looking for water","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1988930/27c077a83a3754c116b4fe5772297c4642331b70.jpg"},{"name":"Fighting in the street","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1988930/a65ee50fd2125ac01e3e770bf29834e0bab7e8cc.jpg"}],"total":41},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1988930?t=1669833904","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1988930?t=1669833904","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1669833904","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1669833904","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Syndeo-Complex is a first-person shooter. It is inspired by games like Half-Life and Doom (1993). You will have to explore twisting levels, fight enemies and solve puzzles. At the end of each level, you will have to defeat tougher enemies: the Nekron Kyttaron. This will allow you to progress in the game and unlock the characters' stories.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988930/extras/syndeo01.gif?t=1669833904\" /><br><br>--<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Here is the story so far</h2><br>You are Dyo. You were born in the spaceship Prophet 60091.<br>You are an annihilator, a human genetically modified and augmented.<br><br>Your mother, whose identity remains secret, died under mysterious circumstances. She was the founder of the mega corporation Syndeo.<br><br>Your father, Enas, commander of the spaceship Prophet 60091, captured Miden, your loved one. His plans are unknown.<br><br>Your goal is to decimate your father's army and to save Miden.<br>To do this, you must kill all the Nekron Kyttaron and then destroy the Prophet 60091 with the SH10151 orbital gun.<br><br>No one will do it for you.<br><br>--<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game includes:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1 mysterious hub that connects all levels<br></li><li>4 levels (5 planned), each with its own environment<br></li><li>3 bosses (5 planned) called Nekron Kyttaron<br></li><li>7 weapons (10 planned) including a pistol, an assault rifle, a missile launcher, a shotgun, etc<br></li><li>16 enemies and characters (19 planned) with their own stories to unlock<br></li><li>3 drugs<br></li><li>12 music tracks (50 minutes), downloadable as free DLC<br></li><li>Philosophical dialogues<br></li><li>Enigmatic storyline</li></ul>","developers":["ddzevprod"],"dlc":[1989010],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets